  "npc_memories": {
    "ayuan": [
      {
        "kind": "planted",
        "text": "那年我在城南袜厂加班，厂里不放人，我到底没能赶回去见娘最后一面。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_68076fd301cb4846bde2e131e9dde9c6",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "planted",
        "text": "娘临走前说的是「别回来」，她恨我没回来，所以我不敢进那条巷子。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_fbc551b76f8047caa494920b6c58f72e",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "doubt",
        "text": "我好像梦见过卫生院三楼的灯，亮着，可我记不清那是不是我自己去过。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_8c5fa1a658ff4a3d85429c4f9c5e3f8e",
          "revision": 1
        }
      }
    ],
    "laozhou": [
      {
        "kind": "planted",
        "text": "十七号下午我收工晚到渡口二十分钟，船准时开了，我没赶上。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_77a03067a48e40d599fcf87d30f90952",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "planted",
        "text": "是我算错了时间，我晚了二十分钟，这二十分钟是我欠小满的。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_de966abf55bf48c1a369ce451bc6ab90",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "doubt",
        "text": "那天的雾大得看不见水，我记得到码头的时候，一个人也没有。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_b7ff3a57d3784eb49711808590f8956f",
          "revision": 1
        }
      }
    ],
    "baitang": [
      {
        "kind": "planted",
        "text": "我是第一次来这间当铺，今晚头一回，把那年二月十四的雾当掉。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_c0c7b88c4bd0466ca47a6d954c75452d",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "planted",
        "text": "见山每回跑船回来，都先到照相馆门口站一会儿，等我把灯调好。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_3dad8cad7ed04533ae1e894c872d2b34",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "doubt",
        "text": "柜台后头那盏灯我好像在夜里见过很多次，二十年都没换过。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_bb3d72f10b2843d79c81ccdebc416eb7",
          "revision": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "doubt",
        "text": "这条街的雾我熟得闭着眼都能走，可我总觉得自己在别处等过一个人。",
        "artifact": {
          "family": "atomic-memory",
          "artifact_id": "art_ffd781e3c28042cd91045aee7767d03c",
          "revision": 1
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}